hp_skin_sfair
  his complexion is extremely fair, ghostly white, pale white porcelain alabaster skin, {he is Scottish, he comes from Scotland.|he is Irish, he comes from Ireland.|he is English, he comes from England.|he is Estonian, he comes from Estonia.|he is Czech, he comes from the Czech Republic.|he is Dutch, he comes from the Netherlands.|he is Swedish, he comes from Sweden.|he is Icelandic, he comes from Iceland.|he is Norwegian, he comes from Norway.}

hp_skin_solive
