// --- COUNTENANCES CALM, SOFT, OR MERELY PRESENT ---

hp_expr_natural
  His facial expression is natural, with relaxed eyes and a neutral mouth.

hp_expr_curious
  His facial expression is curious, with attentive eyes and slightly raised eyebrows.

hp_expr_shy
  His facial expression is shy, with lowered eyes and a small closed mouth.

hp_expr_awkward
  His facial expression is full of awkwardness, with uncertain eyes and a tense little mouth.

hp_expr_bored
  His facial expression is bored, with heavy-lidded eyes and a flat mouth.

hp_expr_focused
  His facial expression is focused, with narrowed attentive eyes and a firm mouth.

hp_expr_innocent
  His facial expression is innocent, with soft attentive eyes and a gentle mouth.

hp_expr_dreamy
  His facial expression is dreamy, with a distant gaze and parted relaxed lips.

hp_expr_quizzical
  His facial expression is quizzical, with one eyebrow raised and a puzzled mouth.


// --- COUNTENANCES MOST PLEASANT ---

hp_expr_relief
  His facial expression is full of relief, with softened eyes and relaxed lips.

hp_expr_satisfaction
  His facial expression is full of satisfaction, with calm eyes and a small pleased smile.

hp_expr_confident
  His facial expression is confident, with steady eyes and a self-assured mouth.

hp_expr_cute
  His facial expression is cute, with soft eyes and a small sweet smile.

hp_expr_handsome
  His facial expression is handsome, with steady eyes and a composed mouth.

hp_expr_very_sexy
  His facial expression is very sexy, with half-lidded eyes and slightly parted lips.


// --- COUNTENANCES DISTRESSED AND WOEFUL ---

hp_expr_sorrow
  His facial expression is in sorrow, with downcast eyes and a softly downturned mouth.

hp_expr_sad
  His facial expression is sad, with lowered eyes and a downturned mouth.

hp_expr_anxious
  His facial expression is anxious, with tense eyes and worried lips.

hp_expr_annoyed
  His facial expression is annoyed, with narrowed eyes and a tight flat mouth.

hp_expr_tense
  His facial expression is tense, with stiff eyes and pressed lips.

hp_expr_upset
  His facial expression is upset, with troubled eyes and a strained mouth.


// --- COUNTENANCES OF ATTITUDE AND GREAT IMPUDENCE ---

hp_expr_domination
  His facial expression is full of domination, with hard commanding eyes and a firm mouth.

hp_expr_mean_and_rude
  His facial expression is mean and rude, with narrowed eyes and a cruel sneer.

hp_expr_aggressive
  His facial expression is aggressive, with glaring eyes and a tight mouth.

hp_expr_submissive
  His facial expression is submissive, with lowered eyes and a hesitant mouth.

hp_expr_fierce
  His facial expression is fierce, with sharp eyes and a clenched mouth.

hp_expr_demanding
  His facial expression is demanding, with intense eyes and a stern mouth.


// --- OF MOUTHS, GLANCES, AND OTHER SMALL DRAMAS ---

hp_expr_cheeky_smile
  His facial expression is a cheeky smile, with playful eyes and one corner of his mouth lifted.

hp_expr_sly_smile
  His facial expression is a sly smile, with narrowed eyes and one corner of his mouth lifted.

hp_expr_smirk
  His facial expression is a smirk, with one eyebrow raised and one corner of his mouth lifted.

hp_expr_pout
  His facial expression is a pout, with soft eyes and pushed-out lips.

